{"id":"wb-6-250","name":"高氏家族墓地","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"高氏家族墓地","text":"高氏家族墓地位于浙江省乐清市白象镇高东村。墓地分三组，中为明朝刑部尚书高友玑及其祖父、父亲墓，左为高友玑长子、三子墓，右为次子、四子墓，按左昭右穆礼俗排列。2006年5月25日，列入第六批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%AB%98%E6%B0%8F%E5%AE%B6%E6%97%8F%E5%A2%93%E5%9C%B0","revisionId":89304192,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=89304192","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/8be79f84c4249dd78fb29fb2.jpg","title":"Tombs_of_the_Gao_Family_in_Yueqing,_2021-05-01_06.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tombs_of_the_Gao_Family_in_Yueqing,_2021-05-01_06.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d1/Tombs_of_the_Gao_Family_in_Yueqing%2C_2021-05-01_06.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​乐清高氏家族墓地","width":320,"height":214}}